{"product_id":"pushing-perfect-pb","title":"PUSHING PERFECT","description":"\u003cp\u003eKara has the perfect life. She gets perfect grades. She never messes up. Until now. Because perfection is an illusion, and Kara has been struggling to maintain it for as long as she can remember. With so much pressure to succeed, it’s hard not to do whatever it takes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBut when Kara takes a new underground drug to help her ace the SATs, she doesn’t expect to get a text from a blocked sender, telling her to follow a set of mysterious instructions—or risk her dark secret getting out. Soon she finds herself part of a group of teens with secrets of their own, who are all under the thumb of the same anonymous texter. And if they don’t find a way to stop the blackmailer, their perfect futures will go up in flames.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n \u003cp\u003eDimensions:23 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Michelle Falkoff \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780008110697 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43526158123161,"sku":"1RA9780008110697","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/PUSHINGPERFECT-PB.jpg?v=1701946146","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/pushing-perfect-pb","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}